flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Print current WiFi mode]
    B --> C[Print debug mode active message]
    C --> D[Set WiFi mode to access point]
    D --> E[Delay startup]

    E --> F[Create access point IP address]
    F --> G[Create gateway address]
    G --> H[Create network mask]

    H --> I[Configure soft access point]

    I --> J{SoftAP start successful}

    J -- No --> K[Print SoftAP failed]
    K --> L([Return])

    J -- Yes --> M[Get access point IP]
    M --> N[Print access point IP address]

    N --> O[Configure soft access point again]
    O --> P[Print configuration result]

    P --> Q[Start access point]
    Q --> R[Print AP start result]

    R --> S[Print access point IP]
    S --> T[Print access point SSID]

    T --> U[Create web server endpoint]
    U --> V[Set connection close header]
    V --> W[Send HTTP response]

    W --> X[Initialize ESP2SOTA library]
    X --> Y[Start web server]

    Y --> Z([End])
